231 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (John entered the working world as a civilian electrical engineer at Picatinny Arsenal in New Jersey. His career at Picatinny spanned 50 years: 38 full-time and 12 part-time. He met his wife Mary there. They married in 1970 and settled in Stanhope, NJ. John has one son, Ian, and three grandsons. They all now reside on Cape Cod.  )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [10]
>>
